{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "142a941ee1320b742bc219e0d98643c2e0d094e6528989b66e3c49ae08cf51f3", "ja": "（今日の仕事は、夜桜ライブ。\n飾りつけや機材の準備は順調だな！）", "zh": "（今天的工作是夜樱演唱会，\n布置跟器材的准备都很顺利呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "8aa0677366a55b4db6f298c54120cdbf007cf89c3ed66a1773f22c422aa91807", "ja": "{$P$}！\nあっちの飾りつけ、終わったヨー！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n那边都装饰好啰～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4bc38dedb1234e78cef19ccc3ffbe048271b56cb8fd372a4bbf07575bbb7509c", "ja": "ありがとうエレナ。今日はライブの\n出演者なんだから、ゆっくりしてていいのに。", "zh": "谢谢你，艾琳娜。今天的演唱会你也要上台表演，\n其实用不着这样忙东忙西的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "b8da242cec391e62a724dcf9f9a1b41b9465567b4e289c0a5f7ad0f1bd3b784b", "ja": "何言ってるノ、{$P$}！\nお祭りは、準備の時から始まってるんだヨ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，你在说什么呀！\n准备阶段就已经是庆典的一部分啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "94a30c49667d630629bf6660c0196266644992b3e243bdf5956afe55de90176a", "ja": "みんなで一緒に飾りつけ、すっごく楽しいのに。\nじっと見てるだけなんてつまんないヨ！", "zh": "和大家一起布置这么有趣，\n如果只在旁边看就太没意思了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8ad21f5bdb9dfaf34be7799979de3a844b4c1f8fcec379a1771ad96b42c4ebaf", "ja": "なるほど……。こういう設営も、\nエレナにとっては楽しいイベントなのか。", "zh": "原来如此……对艾琳娜来说，\n这种场地布置作业也是有趣的活动啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "c28695b7b6541d4ed376afcbd80817b0968d52fcdff74bf30ffea9dfe28d7161", "ja": "そうだヨ！　リオのカーニバルなんて、\n1年がかりで、お祭りの準備するんだからネ！", "zh": "没错！里约的嘉年华\n甚至会花一整年来为庆典做准备喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "86b2d5c9193deafca4fcace9a65392d1832822fd7dd2651cd164d767fc31c402", "ja": "衣装を作ったり、パレードの車を作ったり。\nワクワクするお仕事がいっぱいなんだヨ♪", "zh": "像是缝制服装、打造游行花车，\n有好多好多令人雀跃的工作喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d9d9d34daa4238b7dfbdbba169128fb7e509c11f03563a5a630a000058b05220", "ja": "たしかに……リオの人達は、\nカーニバルの準備も楽しんでそうだな。", "zh": "这么说也是……\n里约的人，似乎连准备嘉年华都能乐在其中呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "10126c63259d9d0a01bf7763af80418f91a652b25398cf09db84c93d849e29b9", "ja": "でもネ、楽しみすぎちゃって、\nいつも予定より時間かかっちゃうんだヨ。", "zh": "但是呀，因为太期待了，\n每次花的时间都比预计中更久。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "b8c8a20420b73bf847faee9b43d0e9dab8625fac6db2b9d78c9d2a230935c939", "ja": "何か作ってても、音楽が流れてきたら、\nみんなガマンできずに踊りだしちゃうからネ♪", "zh": "因为就算手中在做东西，只要一放音乐，\n大家就会忍不住开始跳舞喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8f5f23b8477ac4205bf888bf7e1d7d4a06c1bff2277d33ecb43bd5cba626ad17", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nこれが、文化の違いなんだな……。", "zh": "是、是喔……\n这就是文化差异啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "d634b82a672b6c856ae32723437637dc0c0a87deba38514cc01ad51faa52aa6d", "ja": "あれれ？　{$P$}！\nあっちの方から、音楽が聞こえてきたヨ？", "zh": "奇怪了？{$P$}！\n那边传来了音乐声耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1013_p", "source_sha256": "62612bcef0450b62dd382997cf083d4ff056ed5f6f8e785b2f727fb3103ca07b", "ja": "ん？　あれは……お花見してる人達だな。\n手拍子で、歌ったり踊ったりしてるみたいだ。", "zh": "嗯？那是……是在赏花的人吧。\n他们似乎正边拍手边唱歌跳舞呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "197bbdf01da62cf61b71265d9cec5f89ee5a9da892c822ad499c3360084c24a4", "ja": "ウズウズ。ウズウズ……。", "zh": "（跃跃欲试、跃跃欲试）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1015_p", "source_sha256": "624b1b54a88f39bca64c9e37534afcbf2c02fe3cf4e9e34f845b8f7fc0ee97ef", "ja": "エレナ。もしかして、踊りたいのか？", "zh": "艾琳娜，你该不会也想跳吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "4429391b64c0e7d8fd5429673fc1adb353ba8812eadd2b1f219f0a4f087cb8a0", "ja": "エヘヘ♪　さすが{$P$}！\nワタシのコト、よくわかってるネ！", "zh": "嘿嘿♪不愧是{$P$}！\n真的很懂我耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1017_p", "source_sha256": "779afd0547f86c628913d9acb04b2eff76fc755f82740682dc6e776245f7c50f", "ja": "お花見の人達の迷惑にならないなら、\n参加してきてもいいけど……。", "zh": "如果不会给赏花的人添麻烦的话，\n是可以去参加啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c8314405c5e64abcab031d66efc8f0f96cc8bf13c635b66b4f9889364259fb2", "ja": "ホント！？　それじゃ、ワタシのダンスで、\nもっともっと盛り上げてきちゃうネ！", "zh": "真的吗！？那我就要用我的舞蹈，\n把气氛炒得更热烈啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "e16b088f130a55525a539e889deddcd2c9da6c42562b21881febc953c852101d", "ja": "イェーイ♪\nみんな、ワタシも入れてーっ♪", "zh": "耶～♪\n各位，让我一起加入吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e9b7ebd8021f9e5f0f1040ea414c5436e9ec352acb00a26c61f558cbe3295177", "ja": "エレナ！　俺もついていくから、先に1人で行かない！\nくれぐれも迷惑はかけないようにな。", "zh": "艾琳娜！我也一起去，你别一个人先走！\n千万别给人家添麻烦啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1021_p", "source_sha256": "385faeb4a6c99d45f6b4717ac9e332474fe3138ef66cf0b5bc33e50db18a76cf", "ja": "それから……夜のライブで踊る体力も、\nちゃんと残しておくように！", "zh": "还有……可别忘了晚上的演唱会你还要跳舞，\n记得保留足够体力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0113_1022_018ele", "source_sha256": "cbaa3c601433a839c6e430ed4b1463c33e8e291b2d1a11127a4b7554eee49bfc", "ja": "ハーイ！\n{$P$}も、一緒に踊ろうネ♪", "zh": "好～！\n{$P$}也一起来跳吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
